# prototype -- X11R6.3 under /opt/amix/X11R6, with /usr/X11R6 linking to it.
#
# Listed from the stage hook's install (imake's install targets, the fonts, rgb.txt),
# one line per object as this build ships it; the header and the lines outside
# /opt/amix/X11R6 are written by hand.  pkginfo is generated from package.sh.
# No install scripts.  X is a hard link to Xzz9000 (l): the stock pkgadd mangles
# a relative symlink target.  /usr/X11R6 is an absolute symlink (SYSTEM_PATHS),
# as stock core's own links are; /usr itself belongs to core and is not
# declared.  Directories 0755 root sys, files 0644 root bin, programs 0755 root
# bin.  Every basename <= 14 bytes, or the roll marks the package UFS-only.
#
